   117	 *
   118	 * Written by \`design/profiles.mjs\`: run \`npm run profiles -w streamdeck\`
   119	 * and commit what moves. Editing it by hand renames a profile the plugin
   120	 * asks for without renaming the file behind it, and the switch then does
